Description Task 6: Install the packages defined in the `openssl_requirements` variable using the package module.

Task 7: Ensure packaging is available via dnf
Description Task 7: Install the `python3-packaging` package using the package module.

Task 8: Install pip packages
Description Task 8: Install the pip packages defined in the `openssl_pip_packages` variable.

Task 9: Create key directory
Description Task 9: Create the directory defined by `openssl_key_directory` with mode 750, owner `openssl_file_owner`, and group `openssl_file_group`.

Task 10: Create csr directory
Description Task 10: Create the directory defined by `openssl_csr_directory` with mode 755, owner `openssl_file_owner`, and group `openssl_file_group`.

Task 11: Create crt directory
Description Task 11: Create the directory defined by `openssl_crt_directory` with mode 755, owner `openssl_file_owner`, and group `openssl_file_group`.

Task 12: Include create tasks
